<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK property basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has issued 700 million American-style call warrants on a basket of three blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd		0.05 shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd     0.05 shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	     0.04 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$10.31	 PREMIUM	 9.78 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2265	GEARING	 5.06x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.APR.98	PAYDATE	 04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  05.JUN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$11.453	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
